{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "5fa70ea3-8482-8aca-8c0f-1cbdb33a291c",
  "created_at": "2025-12-08T15:09:28-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Tito Lopes",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T15:06:17-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin. Good afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T15:06:20-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yeah, good afternoon. I am calling about the storm drain in front of my building. It is on Gibbs Avenue, 156, the Ocean Drive side. And it is still a problem two days after the storm."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T15:06:32-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, 156 Gibbs. Is this from the nor'easter over the weekend?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T15:06:36-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, the nor'easter, Friday and Saturday. The water came up out of the drain and it stayed. It is Monday and the street is still wet around it. It was up to the hubcaps on the cars Saturday, I am not exaggerating."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T15:06:50-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Up to the hubcaps, okay, I'm writing that down. Is the drain itself making any noise or anything?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T15:06:57-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes! It is gurgling, like a, a bubbling sound, all the time. And a smell comes up from it. Like sewer. Very bad. You cannot open a window on that side."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T15:07:07-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Gurgling and a sewer smell. Yeah, that tells us it's backed up somewhere down the line. Has anybody from the city been out there yet?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T15:07:16-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No. Nobody. I see nobody Saturday, nobody Sunday, nobody today. Every time it rains hard it is the same and nobody comes. I am sorry, I am a little angry, but it is true."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T15:07:27-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's fair. You've got a right to be annoyed. Crews have been slammed since the storm, but this one's going on the list."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T15:07:35-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, but will you open a work order? That is what I want to know. A real one, with a date. When is the date?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T15:07:44-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yep, I'll open a work order now, for a backed-up storm drain with odor at 156 Gibbs. As for the date, the crews prioritize by what's flooding roads and homes, so I'd say it's likely this week, but I can't promise you a specific day from my desk."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T15:08:00-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sorry, what does it mean, prioritize by? You mean we are not first?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T15:08:05-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sorry. It means they take the worst spots first, the ones where water's getting into houses or the road's impassable. Yours is in the queue, just not necessarily at the top."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T15:08:15-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. I understand. But I want the work order number, so when I call again I can say, you already have this."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T15:08:23-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. Give me a sec, I'm putting it in. [pause] Okay, I'll need a callback number on it too. What's the best one?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T15:08:31-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, it is 401-555-0180. That is my cell. I am at work now, I do the night shift at the front desk of a hotel, so I am calling from the lobby. If I do not answer, it is because I am sleeping in the day. Leave a message."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T15:08:47-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 401-555-0180, night shift, leave a message. Alright, you're in. The order's entered, and I'll note the gurgling, the smell, and the depth, hubcap level. Somebody from the department will call you with a scheduled day once the crew has it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T15:09:01-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "And the number of the order? You did not say."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T15:09:05-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, you're right. It's generating as I save it, hang on. [pause] It's showing as pending for now, so the number'll come in the callback. I'll flag it so they give it to you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T15:09:16-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Pending. Fine. Please, I hope this week. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T15:09:20-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll do what I can on my end. Take care, and good luck with the shift tonight."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T15:09:26-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. Bye."
    }
  ],
